   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Xin was born into a poor family in Heilongjiang province. She worked part-time in a fast-food restaurant to earn money when she was still in school. Later, she worked as a model to support her family."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Xin’s talent was finally discovered in 2005 by a Hong Kong movie star. But she stayed mostly unknown for years. Still, Xin never gave up. Everything changed when the TV drama "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "Blossoms Shanghai"
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "",
      "zh": "《繁花》"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " came out. She plays a businesswoman in the show. People liked how confident and "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "charming",
      "ref": "v-charming"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " she looked. She became known to more people. Not long after that, she won the "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "Magnolia Award",
      "zh": "白玉兰奖"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " for her stage play "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "Prima Facie"
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "",
      "zh": "《初步举证》"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "After years of hard work, Xin now can finally call herself an “international star”. Let’s "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "cheer for",
      "ref": "v-cheer-for"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " her—and look forward to what she will bring us next."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
